{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "60239b5f9db8e7969c86783f2c14de3c01833362383d22d8fb3d61d69310beb1", "ja": "アゲてこ、神頼み", "zh": "嗨起来吧，向神祈祷", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bcac28dc7b8f22df03b6b8e941a075734951132b8a56189aed82dba142128cab", "ja": "WEB番組の収録後、大事なところで噛んで\nしまった事を気にしているジュリアを励まし\nつつ、息抜きに観光に行きたいと言う一同。\n近くに有名な神社があるとの事で、ツアーの\n成功をお祈りしに行く事に。", "zh": "网络节目收录结束后，大家一边鼓励因在重要地方咬了舌头而耿耿于怀的茱莉亚，一边提议去观光散散心。\n听说附近有一座很有名的神社，于是大家决定前去祈求巡演顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "45f07251e5e8ce10814a0fa544c7df0fcf5205fd203b26a281e1d65372a0e3b5", "ja": "（WEB番組の収録は、無事終了！　……とは、\n言いがたいか。ジュリアがちょっと荒れている）", "zh": "（WEB节目的录制顺利结束了！……不过，也很难这么说啊。茱莉亚好像有点情绪不佳。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "469c5270c03f914b96fdd56d7f0fd66192c929caf252e0171a3446d38cf0765b", "ja": "ああもう、最悪だよ……あんな大事なとこで！\nクールに決めようと思ってたのに……。", "zh": "啊，真是糟透了……偏偏在那么重要的地方出岔子！\n本来想帅气地表现一番的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "5239d7d68a98e52224e21a2b5e2f727a9e2c28cfcfbcc2ba982f7cd152bbb52d", "ja": "でもジュリア、可愛かったよ☆\nきっと宣伝効果もバッチリだったと思う！", "zh": "不过茱莉亚，很可爱哦☆\n宣传效果肯定也特别棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "59ddf2b9f6f13a27a81dc9460b3647063dfaff50a9e19bc4b0b51c7fa3f2fc7b", "ja": "ほんとかよ……。\nっていうか、そんなの狙ってないし！", "zh": "真的假的……。\n话说回来，我本来就没打算那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "a72799a15186732c09adb36574badee244245ae3f6141dd4ab315c89f8cf6467", "ja": "ふふっ、たまにはいいじゃない。普段クールな\nジュリアの可愛いとこが見られて、ファンも喜ぶわよ？", "zh": "呵呵，偶尔这样也不错嘛。能看到平时一向很酷的\n茱莉亚可爱的一面，粉丝们也会很开心的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "0dbb6d1926ddf626e9491ac346fac4d773f376d11849ca9515d1ce2bdeb5fca6", "ja": "そうですよー！\nジュリアさん、とっても可愛かったです♪", "zh": "就是嘛——！  \n茱莉亚，刚才特别可爱呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "10cc022a53f1d721e3a5ac0872162d0a0c580a694e3981463b7acbcce4934281", "ja": "ヤッコまで……くぅ。\nおい{$P$}、何も言うなよ！", "zh": "连雅子都……呜。\n喂，{$P$}，什么都别说啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8e8e7de2a7a4c5aa0e75304c1166e713b636d0563edd10e66b76189f3c3e09df", "ja": "おっと……。", "zh": "哎呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "ecda4882d5d53ae4d338adafb2d7bb82c24cbdb0b83638ec44362ae8e0aaf77e", "ja": "{$P$}、ところで、\n今日はこの後、どうするんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，对了，今天接下来有什么安排吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "95ccc9a9d0061d8d7f51ce59a5ce710cfd1ebc1f5f775651ca897eb7d7d8bf41", "ja": "ん？　特にスケジュールは入れてないよ。\nしっかり休んで貰おうと思って。", "zh": "嗯？我没特意安排日程哦。\n想着让大家好好休息一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "0c131e5693d03622cc26e7e63364a351530bdc6961800d10f9289960a9038e31", "ja": "でしたら、ちょっと観光に行きたいんですけど。\n息抜きってことで……ダメですか？", "zh": "既然这样，我想去逛逛，可以吗？\n就当是放松一下……不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "051587ac41d0d087d98c1b719dabcdd09cfed966458847c8d31a9468379971e2", "ja": "えっ、行きたい行きたーいっ！\n{$P$}お願い、連れてって！", "zh": "诶，我想去！我想去嘛——！\n{$P$}拜托了，带我们去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d700cb075e24dc37ea8f2664972f892426ccca4894aa0df19c19ae923a8797ad", "ja": "まあ、少しならいいよ。\nそれで、どこに行きたいんだ？　みんなで決めてくれ。", "zh": "好吧，稍微去一下倒也行。\n那么，你们想去哪儿？大家商量着决定吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "aeab18c6615d30131b31ef6b3cf92b987cc89a973cc4e6a0feb35657d3df97c6", "ja": "ええと……近くに、植物園があったわよね。\nあとは確か、山の方に有名な神社が……。", "zh": "嗯……附近好像有植物园吧。\n另外，我记得山那边还有座很有名的神社……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "0d7855cb2b37e82c2603d2454853f1cd445d420d0ee24bffc0f6030c00c6bff3", "ja": "あ、神社っていいかも！\nツアーが成功しますようにって、お願いしませんか？", "zh": "啊，神社好像也不错！\n要不要去祈求巡演能够顺利成功？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "015e5cb40b7b91017b5dd679b2ca7237b5aa59de8cdecb38e1f502654385f941", "ja": "うんうん！　私達、レッスンもしっかりやってるし。\n後は神様にお祈りするだけだよね。いいと思うっ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！我们也认真训练了。接下来只要向神明祈祷就行了吧。我觉得不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "177a74ef84aa94e16bb706e12dfa83bf38a9d2e9f436d402e64008a77e1403b0", "ja": "ジュリアさんも、一緒に行きましょー。\nお祈りしたら、気持ちもググーッて盛り上がりますよ！", "zh": "茱莉亚先生也一起去吧——\n祈祷之后，心情也会一下子高涨起来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "364978274d79cfeb5fa621ac980eebed385e1b28efd2ce60cc3085e73b46ca37", "ja": "……。ははっ！　わかったわかった。\nみんなには敵わないよな、ホント。", "zh": "……哈哈！知道了知道了。\n我真是拿你们没办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "410fe5c889297ca42964e7ba8e48195f7f16e848a6f9a151b627e9796e9656b0", "ja": "噛んだこと気にして、ずっとウジウジしてるようじゃ、\nそっちのがダサいしな！　よし、行こうぜ。", "zh": "要是老在纠结吃螺丝的事，一直在那闷闷不乐，\n反而更逊了呢！好，出发吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "97a7e8c1337bc09c3d77ee2cc3bbf8e3d7a80e2c826b68e7153d469f0a9a0132", "ja": "ジュリア、元気出たんだ？　よかったーっ☆\nそれじゃ、みんなで山まで競争しよー！　よーいドン☆", "zh": "茱莉亚，打起精神了？太好了——☆  \n那么，大家一起比赛跑到山上去吧！预备，跑☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "e3fd77c788ee38af024857f4f7509d0511222c52a443db634eb97eb104146974", "ja": "えっ！？　さすがに走っていける距離じゃないわよ！\nちょっと、海美～！？", "zh": "诶！？这距离可不是靠跑就能到的呀！\n等等，海美～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "352c6dccc1b56adf662d484424ea295fb5640160e70b9359d50836af641f3e7e", "ja": "ま、待ってくださーい、海美さーんっ！", "zh": "等、等等我啊——，海美小姐——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_04_1022_p", "source_sha256": "ad6c1a9c1d18d2d3da0b4b5370cc89ef943eef7e1101fc7a97c6783b8d198ea4", "ja": "（今のみんななら、きっと神様も味方してくれるに\n違いない。しっかりお祈りしておかないとな！）", "zh": "（现在的大家一定能得到神明的庇佑。得好好祈祷才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
